/**
 * @example slice-s2-zero-speed.cxx
 *
 * @brief [en] Zero and low speed: injection, and the machines it refuses to work on.
 * @brief [zh] 零速与低速：注入，以及它拒绝在哪些机器上工作。
 *
 * @section s2_shows [en] What the example shows [zh] 这个例子展示了什么
 * @par [en] A standstill salient machine driven by the observer's own injection, three times: a surface-mount rotor,
 *      an interior rotor, and an interior rotor whose carrier the controller cannot resolve. Only the middle one ever
 *      publishes an estimate that moves.
 * @par [zh] 一台静止的凸极电机，由观测器自己的注入驱动，跑三次：表贴式转子、内置式转子、以及内置式转子但控制器
 *      分辨不了那个载波。只有中间那一次发布出会动的估计。
 *
 * @section s2_gain [en] Why the surface-mount run is not a tuning problem [zh] 为什么表贴式那一次不是调参问题
 * @par [en] The demodulation sensitivity comes from `predicted_gain_a()`, and at a saliency ratio of one it is exactly
 *      zero. A zero is not a small number: there is nothing in the current response for the demodulator to multiply,
 *      so the configuration is refused (`Param`) instead of being run with a gain that would only amplify noise. The
 *      right panel of the figure is that function over the whole range.
 * @par [zh] 解调灵敏度来自 `predicted_gain_a()`，在凸极比为一时它恰好是零。零不是一个很小的数：电流响应里没有
 *      东西可供解调器相乘，所以配置被拒绝（`Param`），而不是以一个只会放大噪声的增益跑起来。图的右半就是这条
 *      函数在整段上的取值。
 *
 * @section s2_silent [en] The two failures that look like success [zh] 两种看起来像成功的失败
 * @par [en] The observer's `error()` is the demodulator's residual, not the angle error: it reads zero when the lock is
 *      perfect and zero when there is no signal at all. `locked()` is the separate answer, and it is the one a start-up
 *      must branch on. The carrier has the same shape: past `max_inject_hz(control_hz)` the demodulated amplitude
 *      collapses, the lock drops out, the angle freezes and the speed reads zero -- a loop closing on that runs away
 *      without any fault being reported, which is why `update()` refuses the configuration instead.
 * @par [zh] 观测器的 `error()` 是解调器的残差，不是角度误差：完美锁定时它读作零，完全没有信号时也读作零。
 *      `locked()` 是那个分开的答案，也是起动流程必须分支的那一个。载波同型：超过 `max_inject_hz(control_hz)` 之后
 *      解调幅值坍塌、锁定掉出、角度冻住、转速读作零——一个闭环会就此跑飞而没有任何故障被报出，所以 `update()`
 *      选择直接拒绝这个配置。
 *
 * @include slice-s2-zero-speed.cxx
 *
 * @note [en] Link the aggregate target `foc::foc`; the command on the first line links the two translation units this
 *            demo needs.
 * @note [zh] 链接聚合目标 `foc::foc`；第一行的命令只链了本演示需要的两个翻译单元。
 *
 * @since 0.1.12
 */
